        <mxCell id="error-list" value="✓ Consistent error format&#xa;✓ Include requestId in errors&#xa;✓ Customize Gateway responses&#xa;✓ Use appropriate status codes&#xa;✓ Add Retry-After for 429&#xa;✓ Log errors with context&#xa;✓ Don't expose stack traces" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
