        <mxCell id="ops-list" value="✓ Infrastructure as Code (SAM/CDK)&#xa;✓ Enable X-Ray tracing&#xa;✓ Set up CloudWatch alarms&#xa;✓ Use canary deployments&#xa;✓ Implement CI/CD pipeline&#xa;✓ Create runbooks&#xa;✓ Test with realistic load" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
